{
  "id": "com.wasmnest.bedcode",
  "name": "BedCode",
  "version": "0.0.1",
  "platform": "mobile",
  "update": { "provider": "github-release" },
  "description": "远程终端控制端：按「项目 → 运行 → 终端」消费桌面端项目与运行，订阅终端输出并发送输入，内置自动任务面板\n· 项目：项目列表与项目内运行来自桌面端；移动端只读项目，项目视角的写面只有启动运行\n· 终端流：订阅回放 + 实时输出，断线自动重连并补齐环窗口\n· 输入：可打印文本与特殊键（Ctrl+C / 方向键 / 功能键）直达桌面 PTY\n· 流控：渲染背压 ack，输出风暴期自动驻留防卡顿\n· 任务：任务页「预设任务 / 定时任务 / 任务记录」，后两者为桌面端任务域的只读视图\n使用：两端连接后进入项目页，打开一个项目并选择 Agent 新建运行（或点活跃运行）即进入终端并自动订阅；离开页面自动断开（不在后台常拉）。自动任务在终端工具栏「自动任务」入口打开，选目标会话后创建任务入队，开启自动执行即按队列顺序调度。",
  "author": "WasmNest",
  "icon": "icon.svg",
  "main": "index.js",
  "pluginType": "full",
  "rustLibrary": "bedcode_plugin_terminal_session",
  "permissions": [
    "auth",
    "bus",
    "network:http",
    "session:read",
    "storage",
    "terminal:output",
    "ui:back",
    "ui:route",
    "ws:client"
  ],
  "contributes": {
    "commands": [
      {
        "id": "bedcode.prewarm",
        "title": "Prewarm Session Terminal Link"
      },
      {
        "id": "bedcode.subscribe",
        "title": "Subscribe Session Terminal"
      },
      {
        "id": "bedcode.unsubscribe",
        "title": "Unsubscribe Session Terminal"
      },
      {
        "id": "bedcode.unsubscribe-all",
        "title": "Unsubscribe All Terminals"
      },
      {
        "id": "bedcode.remove",
        "title": "Remove Session Terminal Link"
      },
      {
        "id": "bedcode.send-input",
        "title": "Send Terminal Input"
      },
      {
        "id": "bedcode.ack-rendered",
        "title": "Ack Rendered Bytes"
      },
      {
        "id": "bedcode.get-state",
        "title": "Get Terminal Link State"
      },
      {
        "id": "bedcode.request-pairing",
        "title": "Request Pairing"
      },
      {
        "id": "bedcode.verify-pairing-code",
        "title": "Verify Pairing Code"
      },
      {
        "id": "bedcode.authenticate-with-qr",
        "title": "Authenticate With QR Token"
      },
      {
        "id": "bedcode.authenticate-with-biometric",
        "title": "Authenticate With Biometric"
      },
      {
        "id": "bedcode.list-sessions",
        "title": "List Sessions"
      },
      {
        "id": "bedcode.start-session",
        "title": "Start Session"
      },
      {
        "id": "bedcode.stop-session",
        "title": "Stop Session"
      },
      {
        "id": "bedcode.remove-session",
        "title": "Remove Session"
      },
      {
        "id": "bedcode.send-http-input",
        "title": "Send Session Input (HTTP)"
      },
      {
        "id": "bedcode.list-projects",
        "title": "List Projects"
      },
      {
        "id": "bedcode.list-runs",
        "title": "List Runs"
      },
      {
        "id": "bedcode.start-run",
        "title": "Start Run"
      },
      {
        "id": "bedcode.list-agents",
        "title": "List Agents"
      }
    ],
    "routes": [
      {
        "id": "tasks",
        "component": "AutoTaskToolboxView",
        "header": true
      }
    ]
  }
}
